1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,404
As Uke comes to strike the side of your head,

2
00:00:02,405 --> 00:00:04,111
take a big step forward

3
00:00:04,112 --> 00:00:06,713
leading the strike around in a big circular movement,

4
00:00:06,714 --> 00:00:08,106
controlling his wrist

5
00:00:08,107 --> 00:00:09,756
draw across the body

6
00:00:09,757 --> 00:00:12,841
and turn again cutting down directly in front of you

7
00:00:12,842 --> 00:00:14,356
control his elbow,

8
00:00:14,357 --> 00:00:17,802
draw Uke into your center 
so his shoulder is in between your knees,

9
00:00:17,803 --> 00:00:19,511
controlling his wrist against the body,

10
00:00:19,512 --> 00:00:21,740
turn towards his head for the pin.

